分類名稱，系統將在儲存時將該分類從清單中移除。','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'如果最近在設定中更改了登入 Cookie，請先登出再重新登入。','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'如果輸入的標籤代稱不正確，儲存設定時便會在清單中移除。','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'如有任何疑問，團隊隨時樂意在 %ssupport 論壇%s 上為您解答。','If this is set to a number less than 30, feeds will not be cached.'=>'如果設定值小於 30，便不會為資訊提供進行快取。','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'若使用 OpenLiteSpeed，必須重新啟動伺服器一次，變更設定才會生效。','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'如果您使用的是 %1$s 連接埠，則 %2$s 應設定為 %3$s','If you have used Image Optimization, please %sDestroy All Optimization Data%s first. NOTE: this does not remove your optimized images.'=>'如果您曾使用「圖片最佳化」功能，請先 %s刪除所有最佳化資料%s。注意：此操作不會移除您已最佳化的圖片。','If you run into any issues, please refer to the report number in your support message.'=>'若您遇到任何問題，請參閱支援訊息中的報告編號。','If you turn any of the above settings OFF, please remove the related file types from the %s box.'=>'若您將上述任何設定設為「關閉」，請將相關檔案類型從 %s 方塊中移除。','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'如果您不希望以光速移動，可以停用此外掛程式。','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'如果您的網站包含某些使用者角色可以查看、但其他角色無法查看的公開內容，您可以為這些使用者角色指定一個 Vary Group。例如，指定一個「管理員」Vary Group 後，系統會為管理員生成一個專屬的公開快取頁面（包含「編輯」連結等），而其他所有使用者角色則會看到預設的公開頁面。','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'如果您的佈景主題未使用 JavaScript 來更新迷你購物車，您必須啟用此選項，才能正確顯示購物車內容。','Iframes containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'包含這些類別名稱的 Iframe 將不會進行延遲載入。','Iframes having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'具有這些父類別名稱的 iframe 將不會被延遲載入。','Ignore certain query strings when caching. (LSWS %s required)'=>'在快取時忽略某些查詢字串。（需啟用 LSWS %s）','Image groups total'=>'圖片組總數','Image Information'=>'圖片資訊','Image Optimization'=>'圖片最佳化','Image Optimization Settings'=>'圖片最佳化設定','Image Optimization Summary'=>'圖片優化摘要','Image Thumbnail Group Sizes'=>'圖片縮圖群組大小','Images containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'包含這些類別名稱的圖片將不會進行延遲載入。','Images having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'具有這些父類別名稱的圖片將不會被延遲載入。','Images not requested'=>'未請求的圖片','Images notified to pull'=>'已通知需拉取的圖片','Images optimized and pulled'=>'圖片已優化並載入','Images Pulled'=>'圖片已移除','Images ready to request'=>'可立即索取的圖片','Images requested'=>'請提供圖片','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'如果 cron 工作正在執行，系統將自動載入圖片。','Import'=>'匯入','Import / Export'=>'匯入/匯出','Import failed due to file error.'=>'由於檔案發生錯誤，因此無法匯入。','Import Settings'=>'匯入設定','Imported setting file %s successfully.'=>'設定檔 %s 已成功匯入。','Improve HTTP/HTTPS Compatibility'=>'提升 HTTP/HTTPS 相容性','Improve wp-admin speed through caching. (May encounter expired data)'=>'透過快取功能提升 wp-admin 的運作速度。（可能會遇到過期資料）','Improved by'=>'由……改進','In order to avoid an upgrade error, you must be using %1$s or later before you can upgrade to %2$s versions.'=>'為避免升級錯誤，您必須先使用 %1$s 或更新版本，才能升級至 %2$s 版本。','In order to use most QUIC.cloud services, you need quota. QUIC.cloud gives you free quota every month, but if you need more, you can purchase it.'=>'若要使用大多數 QUIC.cloud 服務，您需要配額。QUIC.cloud 每月會提供免費配額，但若您需要更多配額，亦可購買。','In order to use QC services, need a real domain name, cannot use an IP.'=>'若要使用 QC 服務，必須使用真實的網域名稱，不可使用 IP 位址。','Include CSS'=>'包含 CSS','Include external CSS and inline CSS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of CSS, which should minimize potential errors caused by C