密碼連結','Path must end with %s'=>'路徑必須以 %s 結尾','Paths containing these strings will be cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'包含這些字串的路徑將會被快取，無論其設定是否為不可快取。','Paths containing these strings will be forced to public cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'包含這些字串的路徑將被強制納入公開快取，無論其「不可快取」設定為何。','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'包含這些字串的路徑將不會被快取。','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'包含這些字串的路徑將不會透過 CDN 提供。','Pay as You Go'=>'隨用隨付','Pay as You Go Usage Statistics'=>'隨用隨付使用統計','PAYG Balance'=>'按用計費餘額','PAYG used this month: %s. PAYG balance and usage not included in above quota calculation.'=>'本月已使用的預付額度：%s。預付額度餘額及使用量不計入上述配額計算。','Persistent Connection'=>'持久連線','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'支援 PHP 常數 %s。','pixels'=>'像素','Please consider disabling the following detected plugins, as they may conflict with LiteSpeed Cache:'=>'請考慮停用以下已偵測到的外掛程式，因為它們可能會與 LiteSpeed Cache 產生衝突：','Please do NOT share the above passwordless link with anyone.'=>'請切勿將上述無密碼連結分享給任何人。','Please enable LiteSpeed Cache in the plugin settings.'=>'請在外掛設定中啟用 [LiteSpeed 快取功能]。','Please enable the LSCache Module at the server level, or ask your hosting provider.'=>'請在伺服器層級啟用 LSCache 模組，或向您的主機服務供應商洽詢。','Please make sure this IP is the correct one for visiting your site.'=>'請確認此 IP 位址是否為瀏覽貴網站的正確位址。','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'在啟用此選項之前，請務必閱讀所有警告。','Please see %s for more details.'=>'更多詳情請參閱 %s。','Please see %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s to learn how to create the system cron task.'=>'請參閱 %s將 WP-Cron 整合至系統工作排程器%s，了解如何建立系統 cron 工作。','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'啟用此清單中的任何選項時，請務必進行徹底測試。變更「壓縮/合併」設定後，請執行「清除所有快取」操作。','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'請徹底測試 %s 中的所有項目，以確保其運作符合預期。','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.