e product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'僅在庫存狀態變更時清除商品與類別。','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'當數量或庫存狀態發生變更時，清除相關商品資料。','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'僅在庫存狀態發生變更時才清除產品。','Purge Settings'=>'清除設定','Purge tag %s'=>'清除標籤 [%s]','Purge the cache entries created by this plugin except for Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches'=>'清除此外掛所建立的快取項目，但「關鍵 CSS」、「專屬 CSS」及「LQIP」快取除外','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'清除此外掛程式所建立的 LiteSpeed 快取項目','Purge this page'=>'清除這個頁面的快取','Purge url %s'=>'清除網址 %s','Purged all caches successfully.'=>'全部快取已成功清除。','Purged All!'=>'全數清除！','Purged the blog!'=>'網站已清除。','Purged the URL!'=>'已清除該網址！','Purged!'=>'已清除！','Pushed %1$s to Cloud server, accepted %2$s.'=>'已將 %1$s 上傳至雲端伺服器，並接受 %2$s。','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'包含這些參數的查詢字串將不會被快取。','QUIC.cloud'=>'QUIC.cloud','QUIC.cloud CDN'=>'QUIC.cloud CDN','QUIC.cloud CDN is <strong>not available</strong> for anonymous (unlinked) users.'=>'QUIC.cloud CDN 對匿名（未連結）使用者<strong>不可用</strong>。','QUIC.cloud CDN is currently <strong>fully disabled</strong>.'=>'QUIC.cloud CDN 目前已 <strong>完全停用</strong>。','QUIC.cloud CDN Options'=>'QUIC.cloud CDN 選項','QUIC.cloud CDN Status Overview'=>'QUIC.cloud CDN 狀態概覽','QUIC.cloud CDN:'=>'QUIC.cloud CDN：','QUIC.cloud Integration Disabled'=>'QUIC.cloud 整合功能已停用','QUIC.cloud Integration Enabled'=>'已啟用 QUIC.cloud 整合功能','QUIC.cloud Integration Enabled with limitations'=>'已啟用 QUIC.cloud 整合，但存在某些限制','QUIC.cloud Online Services'=>'QUIC.cloud 線上服務','QUIC.cloud provides CDN and online optimization services, and is not required. You may use many features of this plugin without QUIC.cloud.'=>'QUIC.cloud 提供 CDN 及線上優化服務，但並非必要。即使不使用 QUIC.cloud，您仍可使用此外掛程式的許多功能。','QUIC.cloud Service Usage Statistics'=>'QUIC.cloud 服務使用統計','QUIC.cloud\'s access to your WP REST API seems to be blocked.'=>'QUIC.cloud 似乎無法存取您的 WP REST API。','QUIC.cloud\'s Image Optimization service does the