es'=>'角色排除','Role Simulation'=>'角色扮演','Run %s Queue Manually'=>'手動執行 %s 佇列','Run Frequency'=>'跑步頻率','Run frequency is set by the Interval Between Runs setting.'=>'執行頻率由「執行間隔」設定所決定。','Run Queue Manually'=>'手動執行佇列','Run time for previous crawler'=>'前一個爬蟲程式的執行時間','Running'=>'跑步','running'=>'跑步','Save Changes'=>'儲存設定','Save transients in database when %1$s is %2$s.'=>'當 %1$s 為 %2$s 時，將暫存資料儲存至資料庫。','Saved'=>'已儲存','Saving option failed. IPv4 only for %s.'=>'儲存選項失敗。%s 僅支援 IPv4。','Scaled size threshold'=>'縮放尺寸閾值','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'掃描任何新的未經優化的圖片縮圖尺寸，並重新發送必要的圖片優化請求。','Scheduled Purge Time'=>'預定清除時間','Scheduled Purge URLs'=>'排程清除的 URL','seconds'=>'秒','See %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s for detailed information.'=>'請參閱 %s啟用爬蟲程式的簡介%s 以獲取詳細資訊。','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'如果除了首頁以外的頁面上有與文章連結的動態小工具，請選擇「全部」。','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'請在下方選取 [快取清除條件]。','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'請僅勾選目前正在使用的檔案類型，其餘項目可保持未勾選狀態。','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'請選擇在發佈或更新文章時，哪些頁面將被自動清除。','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'選定的角色將不納入任何優化範圍。','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'選定的角色將從快取中排除。','Selectors must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'選擇器必須存在於 CSS 中。HTML 中的父類別將無法生效。','Send Optimization Request'=>'傳送最佳化請求','Send this report to LiteSpeed. Refer to this report number when posting in the WordPress support forum.'=>'請將此報告傳送至 LiteSpeed。在 WordPress 支援論壇發文時，請註明此報告編號。','Send to LiteSpeed'=>'傳送至 LiteSpeed','Send to twitter to get %s bonus'=>'發送至 Twitter 即可獲得 %s 獎勵','Separate CCSS Cache Post Types'=>'將 CCSS 快取文章類型分開','Separate CCSS Cache URIs'=>'將 CCSS 快取 URI 分開','Separate critical CSS files will be generated for paths containing these strings.'=>'系統會針對包含這些字串的路徑，分別產生獨立的關鍵 CSS 檔案。','Serve a separate cache copy for mobile visitors.'=>'為行動裝置訪客提供獨立的快取副本。','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'請透過 CDN 提供所有 CSS 檔案。此設定將影響所有已排入佇列的 WordPress CSS 檔案。','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'請透過 CDN 提供所有圖片檔案。此設定將影響所有附件、HTML %1$s 標籤以及 CSS %2$s 屬性。','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'請透過 CDN 提供所有 JavaScript 檔案。此設定將影響所有已排入佇列的 WordPress JavaScript 檔案。','Serve Stale'=>'提供過期的','Serve your visitors fast'=>'為訪客提供快速服務','Server allowed max value: %s'=>'伺服器允許的最大值：%s','Server enforced value: %s'=>'伺服器強制設定的值：%s','Server IP'=>'伺服器 IP','Server Load Limit'=>'伺服器負載限制','Server variable(s) %s available to override this setting.'=>'可使用伺服器變數 %s 來覆寫此設定。','Service:'=>'服務：','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'為圖片元素設定明確的寬度和高度，以減少版面位移並改善 CLS（一項核心網路生命力指標）。','Set this to append %1$s to all %2$s rules before caching CSS to specify how fonts should be displayed while being downloaded.'=>'將此設定設為在快取 CSS 之前，將 %1$s 附加至所有 %2$s 規則，以指定字型在下載期間應如何顯示。','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'請將此設定設為 %1$s，以禁止 %2$s 傳送心跳訊號。','Setting Up Custom Headers'=>'設定自訂頁首','Settings'=>'設定','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'將除錯日誌中的查詢字串縮短，以提升可讀性。','Show crawler status'=>'顯示爬蟲狀態','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'透過將圖片替換為其最佳化的 %s 版本，顯著提升載入速度。','Site not recognized. QUIC.cloud deactivated automatically. Please reactivate your QUIC.cloud account.'=>'無法識別該網站。QUIC.cloud 已自動停用。請重新啟用您的 QUIC.cloud 帳戶。','Site performance is worse'=>'網站的表現較差','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'將透過 CDN 提供的網站網址。以 %1$s 開頭。例如：%2$s。','Sitemap cleaned successfully'=>'網站地圖已成功清理','Sitemap created successfully: %d items'=>'網站地圖已成功建立：%d 項','Sitemap List'=>'網站地圖列表','Sitemap Total'=>'網站地圖 總計','Size'=>'尺寸','Size list in queue waiting for cron'=>'排隊中等待 cron 執行的尺寸清單','Smaller than'=>'比……更小','Soft Reset Optimization Counter'=>'軟重置優化計數器','Some optimized image file(s) has expired and was cleared.'=>'部分已優化的圖片檔案已過期並被清除。','Spam Comments'=>'垃圾留言','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'指定一張 Base64 編碼的圖片，作為圖片載入完成前的簡易占位圖。','Specify an AJAX action in POST/GET and the number of seconds to cache that request, separated by a space.'=>'請指定 POST/GET 中的 AJAX 動作，以及該請求的快取時間（以秒為單位），兩者之間以空格分隔。','Specify an HTTP status code and the number of seconds to cache that page, separated by a space.'=>'請指定 HTTP 狀態碼以及該頁面的快取秒數，兩者之間以空格分隔。','Specify an SVG to be used as a placeholder when generating locally.'=>'指定一個 SVG 檔案，作為在本地生成時使用的佔位圖。','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'啟用 %s 時，請為首屏內容指定關鍵 CSS 規則。','Specify how long in seconds before the crawler should initiate crawling the entire sitemap again.'=>'請指定以秒為單位，爬蟲程式應在經過多久後再次開始爬取整個網站地圖。','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'設定資訊提供快取保留時間 (單位為秒)。','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'請指定 Gravatar 檔案的快取時間（以秒為單位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'請指定私有頁面在快取中的保留時間（以秒為單位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'請指定公開頁面應快取多久（以秒為單位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'請指定 REST 呼叫的快取時間（以秒為單位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, the front page is cached.'=>'請指定首頁的快取時間（以秒為單位）。','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'請指定 %s 的心跳間隔（單位為秒）。','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'請指定日誌檔案的最大大小。','Specify the number of most recent revisions to keep when cleaning revisions.'=>'請指定在清理修訂版本時要保留的最近幾次修訂版本的數量。','Specify the password used when connecting.'=>'請指定連線時使用的密碼。','Specify the quality when generating LQIP.'=>'在產生 LQIP 時，請指定品質等級。','Specify the responsive placeholder SVG color.'=>'指定響應式占位符 SVG 的顏色。','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'請指定清除「%s」清單的時間。','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'請指定哪些元素屬性將被 WebP/AVIF 取代。','Specify which HTML element attributes will be replaced with CDN Mapping.'=>'請指定哪些 HTML 元素屬性將被 CDN 映射所取代。','Speed up your WordPress site even further with <strong>QUIC.cloud Online Services and CDN</strong>.'=>'透過 <strong>QUIC.cloud 線上服務與 CDN</strong>，進一步提升您的 WordPress 網站速度。','Speed up your WordPress site even further with QUIC.cloud Online Services and CDN.'=>'透過 QUIC.cloud 線上服務與 CDN，進一步提升您的 WordPress 網站速度。','Spread the love and earn %s credits to use in our QUIC.cloud online services.'=>'分享愛心，即可獲得 %s 點數，用於我們的 QUIC.cloud 線上服務。','Standard Presets'=>'標準預設','Start watching...'=>'開始觀看...','Started async crawling'=>'已開始非同步爬取','Started async image optimization request'=>'已啟動非同步圖片優化請求','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'靜態檔案類型的連結將被 CDN 連結取代。','Status'=>'狀態','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'停止載入 WordPress.org 的表情符號。系統將改為顯示瀏覽器的預設表情符號。','Storage Optimization'=>'儲存空間優化','Store Gravatar locally.'=>'將 Gravatar 儲存至本地。','Store Transients'=>'儲存暫存變數','Submit a ticket'=>'提交工單','Successfully Crawled'=>'已成功爬取','Summary'=>'摘要','Support forum'=>'支援論壇','Sure I\'d love to review!'=>'當然，我很樂意幫忙評測！','Swap'=>'交換','Switch back to using optimized images on your site'=>'請在您的網站上恢復使用已優化的圖片','Switched images successfully.'=>'圖片已成功切換。','Switched to optimized file successfully.'=>'已成功切換至最佳化的檔案。','Sync credit allowance with Cloud Server successfully.'=>'已成功將信用額度與雲端伺服器同步。','Sync data from Cloud'=>'從雲端同步資料','Sync failed.'=>'同步失敗。','Sync QUIC.cloud status successfully.'=>'已成功同步 QUIC.cloud 狀態。','Synced successfully.'=>'已成功同步。','Syncing'=>'同步','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive.'=>'語法：字母、數字及「_」。不得包含空格，且區分大小寫。','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive. MUST BE UNIQUE FROM OTHER WEB APPLICATIONS.'=>'語法：包含字母、數字及「_」。不得包含空格，且區分大小寫。必須與其他網路應用程式不同。','System Information'=>'系統資訊','Table'=>'表格','Tag'=>'標籤','tags'=>'標籤','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'暫時繞過 Cloudflare 快取。此舉可讓對原始伺服器的變更即時顯示。','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'分類法詞彙彙整 (包含分類、標籤及自訂分類法)','Testing'=>'測試','Thank You for Using the LiteSpeed Cache Plugin!'=>'感謝您使用 LiteSpeed Cache 外掛程式！','The above nonces will be converted to ESI automatically.'=>'上述非ce值將自動轉換為 ESI。','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'「管理員 IP」選項僅會針對來自下列所列管理員 IP 的請求輸出日誌訊息。','The amount of time, in seconds, that files will be stored in browser cache before expiring.'=>'檔案在瀏覽器快取中儲存直至過期的時間長度（以秒為單位）。','the auto-detected IP may not be accurate if you have an additional outgoing IP set, or you have multiple IPs configured on your server.'=>'如果您設定了額外的外發 IP，或伺服器上配置了多個 IP，則自動偵測到的 IP 可能不準確。','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'快取系統必須能辨別使用者登入的是哪個 WordPress 網站，才能正確進行快取。','The callback validation to your domain failed due to hash mismatch.'=>'由於雜湊值不符，對您網域的回呼驗證失敗。','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers.'=>'對您網域的回呼驗證失敗。請確認沒有防火牆阻擋我們的伺服器。','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers. Response code: '=>'對您網域的回呼驗證失敗。請確認沒有防火牆阻擋我們的伺服器。回應代碼：','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'此處設定的 Cookie 將用於此 WordPress 安裝。','The crawler feature is not enabled on the LiteSpeed server. Please consult your server admin or hosting provider.'=>'LiteSpeed 伺服器上尚未啟用爬蟲功能。請諮詢您的伺服器管理員或主機服務供應商。','The crawler will use your XML sitemap or sitemap index. Enter the full URL to your sitemap here.'=>'爬蟲程式將使用您的 XML 網站地圖或網站地圖索引。請在此處輸入網站地圖的完整網址。','The current server is under heavy load.'=>'目前伺服器負載過高。','The database has been upgrading in the background since %s. This message will disappear once upgrade is complete.'=>'自 %s 起，資料庫已在後台進行升級。升級完成後，此訊息將消失。','The deactivation is temporary'=>'此停用狀態為暫時性的','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'預設的登入 Cookie 是 %s。','The environment report contains detailed information about the WordPress configuration.'=>'環境報告包含有關 WordPress 設定的詳細資訊。','The features below are provided by %s'=>'以下功能由 %s 提供','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'以下選項已選取，但在此設定頁面上無法編輯。','The image compression quality setting of WordPress out of 100.'=>'WordPress 的圖片壓縮品質設定（滿分 100 分）。','The image list is empty.'=>'圖片清單為空。','The latest data file is'=>'最新的資料檔是','The list will be merged with the predefined nonces in your local data file.'=>'該清單將與您本機資料檔中的預設非重複值進行合併。','The LiteSpeed Cache plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 外掛程式用於快取網頁，這是提升網站效能的一種簡單方法。','The maximum average server load allowed while crawling. The number of crawler threads in use will be actively reduced until average server load falls under this limit. If this cannot be achieved with a single thread, the current crawler run will be terminated.'=>'爬取過程中允許的最大平均伺服器負載。系統將主動減少正在使用的爬蟲執行緒數量，直到平均伺服器負載降至此限制以下為止。若無法透過單一執行緒達成此目標，則當前的爬蟲執行程序將被終止。','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'網路管理員選擇為所有子網站使用主站點設定。','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'多站網路管理中心的設定可以在這個頁面進行變更，但不會影響多站網路管理中心的原始設定。','The next complete sitemap crawl will start at'=>'下一次完整的網站地圖爬取將於','The queue is processed asynchronously. It may take time.'=>'此佇列將以非同步方式處理。此過程可能需要一些時間。','The QUIC.cloud connection is not correct. Please try to sync your QUIC.cloud connection again.'=>'QUIC.cloud 連線不正確。請嘗試重新同步您的 QUIC.cloud 連線。','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'該選擇器必須存在於 CSS 中。HTML 中的父類別將無法生效。','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'伺服器將根據此 Cookie 的存在與否，來判斷使用者是否已登入。','The site is not a valid alias on QUIC.cloud.'=>'該網站在 QUIC.cloud 上並非有效的別名。','The site is not registered on QUIC.cloud.'=>'該網站尚未在 QUIC.cloud 上註冊。','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'此處的網址（每行一個）將在選項「%s」中設定的時間自動清除。','The URLs will be compared to the REQUEST_URI server variable.'=>'這些 URL 將與 REQUEST_URI 伺服器變數進行比對。','The user with id %s has editor access, which is not allowed for the role simulator.'=>'使用者 ID 為 %s 的使用者擁有編輯權限，但此權限不允許授予「模擬者」角色。','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'「視口圖片」服務會偵測哪些圖片出現在瀏覽器首屏範圍內，並將其排除在延遲載入之外。','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'然後在 %s 處安裝了另一個 WordPress（非多站點）','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'%s 已安裝 WordPress。','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet.'=>'尚有待處理的佇列尚未被提取。','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet. Queue info: %s.'=>'尚有未提取的處理佇列。佇列資訊：%s。','These images will not generate LQIP.'=>'這些圖片不會產生 LQIP。','These options are only available with LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server or QUIC.cloud CDN.'=>'這些選項僅適用於 LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server 或 QUIC.cloud CDN。','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'這些設定僅供進階使用者使用。','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'此操作僅應在快取設定不正確時使用。','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'這也可以透過在 %2$s 中使用常數 %1$s 來預先定義，且此設定具有優先權。','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'此舉可透過減少初始 HTTP 請求來提升頁面載入速度。','This can improve quality but may result in larger images than lossy compression will.'=>'這雖然能提升畫質，但產生的影像檔案大小可能會比有損壓縮更大。','This can improve the page loading speed.'=>'這可以提升頁面的載入速度。','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'這有助於提升您在 Pingdom、GTmetrix 和 PageSpeed 等服務中的速度評分。','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'這使得頁面初始顯示的一整屏圖片能夠毫無延遲地完整呈現。','This is irreversible.'=>'這是不可逆轉的。','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'此舉旨在確保在為所有網站啟用快取功能之前，能維持相容性。','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'此低風險預設檔針對速度與使用者體驗進行了基礎優化，適合熱衷於此的初學者。','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'這可能會導致伺服器負載過重。','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'此訊息表示該外掛是由伺服器管理員安裝的。','This Month Usage: %s'=>'本月用量：%s','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'此無風險預設值適用於所有網站。特別適合新使用者、簡易網站或以快取為導向的開發。','This option can help to correct the cache vary for certain advanced mobile or tablet visitors.'=>'此選項可協助修正部分進階行動裝置或平板電腦訪客的快取 Vary 標記。','This option enables maximum optimization for Guest Mode visitors.'=>'此選項可為「訪客模式」的使用者提供最佳化體驗。','This option is bypassed because %1$s option is %2$s.'=>'此選項被跳過，因為 %1$s 選項為 %2$s。','This option is bypassed due to %s option.'=>'由於 %s 選項的存在，此選項將被跳過。','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'此選項可能會導致某些佈景主題或外掛程式在前端頁面引發 JavaScript 錯誤或版面配置問題。','This option will automatically bypass %s option.'=>'此選項將自動跳過 %s 選項。','This option will remove all %s tags from HTML.'=>'此選項將從 HTML 中移除所有 %s 標籤。','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'此預設值幾乎肯定需要針對部分 CSS、JS 以及延遲載入的圖片進行測試與排除。請特別注意標誌，或是基於 HTML 的滑塊圖片。','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'此預設值適用於大多數網站，且不太可能引發衝突。若有任何 CSS 或 JS 衝突，可透過「頁面最佳化」>「調校工具」來解決。','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'此預設值對某些網站可能直接適用，但請務必進行測試！您可能需要在「頁面最佳化 > 調整」中排除某些 CSS 或 JS 檔案。','This process is automatic.'=>'此流程是自動進行的。','This setting is %1$s for certain qualifying requests due to %2$s!'=>'由於 %2$s 的原因，此設定對某些符合資格的請求為 %1$s！','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'此設定對於在同一網域下擁有多個網頁應用程式的使用者相當實用。','This setting will edit the .htaccess file.'=>'這項設定會變更 .htaccess 檔案內容。','This setting will regenerate crawler list and clear the disabled list!'=>'此設定將重新產生爬蟲清單並清除已停用清單！','This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily.'=>'本網站採用快取技術，以提升回應速度並提供更佳的使用者體驗。快取機制可能會儲存本網站上所有顯示網頁的副本。 所有快取檔案均屬臨時性質，且絕不會被任何第三方存取，惟為向快取外掛程式供應商取得技術支援而必要時除外。快取檔案將依照網站管理員設定的時程自動過期，但如有需要，管理員亦可於其自然過期前隨時手動清除。我們可能會使用 QUIC.cloud 服務來暫時處理及快取您的資料。','This value is overwritten by the %s variable.'=>'此值將被 %s 變數覆寫。','This value is overwritten by the filter.'=>'此值將被篩選器覆寫。','This value is overwritten by the Network setting.'=>'此值將被「網路」設定所覆寫。','This value is overwritten by the PHP constant %s.'=>'此值將被 PHP 常數 %s 覆寫。','This value is overwritten by the primary site setting.'=>'此值將被主要網站設定所覆寫。','This will affect all tags containing attributes: %s.'=>'這將影響所有包含 %s 屬性的標籤。','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'這也會為 Google Fonts 新增一個預先連線，以便更早建立連線。','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'此操作將備份您的當前設定，並以 %1$s 的預設設定取代。您要繼續嗎？','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'這將清除快取中的所有內容。','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'這將刪除所有已快取的 Gravatar 檔案','This will delete all generated critical CSS files'=>'這將刪除所有已生成的關鍵 CSS 檔案','This will delete all generated image LQIP placeholder files'=>'這將刪除所有已生成的 LQIP 圖片占位檔','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'這將刪除所有已生成的獨立 CSS 檔案','This will delete all generated Viewport Images'=>'這將刪除所有已生成的視口影像','This will delete all localized resources'=>'這將刪除所有本地化資源','This will disable LSCache and all optimization features for debug purpose.'=>'此操作將停用 LSCache 以及所有優化功能，以便進行除錯。','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'這將停用所有子網站上的設定頁面。','This will drop the unused CSS on each page from the combined file.'=>'這將從合併檔案中移除各頁面中未使用的 CSS。','This will enable crawler cron.'=>'這將啟用爬蟲的排程任務。','This will export all current LiteSpeed Cache settings and save them as a file.'=>'這將匯出所有當前的 LiteSpeed Cache 設定，並將其儲存為檔案。','This will generate extra requests to the server, which will increase server load.'=>'這會產生額外的伺服器請求，從而增加伺服器負載。','This will generate the placeholder with same dimensions as the image if it has the width and height attributes.'=>'如果圖片具有 width 和 height 屬性，這將產生與該圖片尺寸相同的占位符。','This will import settings from a file and override all current LiteSpeed Cache settings.'=>'使用這項功能便能從檔案匯入並覆寫目前 LiteSpeed Cache 外掛的全部設定。','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'這會增加優化後檔案的大小。','This will inline the asynchronous CSS library to avoid render blocking.'=>'這將把非同步 CSS 函式庫內嵌，以避免阻塞渲染。','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'這項功能僅會清除已最小化/已合併的 CSS/JS 項目。','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'這項功能僅會清除靜態首頁快取。','This will Purge Pages only'=>'這項功能僅會清除頁面快取。','This will reset all settings to default settings.'=>'使用這項功能便會將全部設定重設為預設值。','This will reset the %1$s. If you changed WebP/AVIF settings and want to generate %2$s for the previously optimized images, use this action.'=>'這將重置 %1$s。如果您已變更 WebP/AVIF 設定，並希望針對先前已優化的圖片產生 %2$s，請使用此動作。','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'這將還原在套用 %2$s 預設值之前所建立的 %1$s 備份設定。此後所做的任何變更都將遺失。您要繼續嗎？','Time to execute previous request: %s'=>'執行前一項請求所需的時間：%s','To crawl for a particular cookie, enter the cookie name, and the values you wish to crawl for. Values should be one per line. There will be one crawler created per cookie value, per simulated role.'=>'若要擷取特定 Cookie，請輸入 Cookie 名稱以及您希望擷取的值。每個值應佔一行。系統將針對每個 Cookie 值及每個模擬角色，建立一個爬蟲。','To crawl the site as a logged-in user, enter the user ids to be simulated.'=>'若要以已登入使用者的身分爬取網站，請輸入要模擬的使用者 ID。','To define a custom TTL for a URI, add a space followed by the TTL value to the end of the URI.'=>'若要為 URI 設定自訂 TTL，請在 URI 結尾處加入一個空格，然後接上 TTL 值。','To do an exact match, add %s to the end of the URL.'=>'若要進行完全匹配，請在 URL 結尾處加上 %s。','To enable the following functionality, turn ON Cloudflare API in CDN Settings.'=>'若要啟用以下功能，請在 CDN 設定中開啟 Cloudflare API。','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'如需排除 %1$s，請輸入代稱 %2$s。','To generate a passwordless link for LiteSpeed Support Team access, you must install %s.'=>'若要產生供 LiteSpeed 支援團隊存取的無密碼連結，您必須安裝 %s。','To grant wp-admin access to the LiteSpeed Support Team, please generate a passwordless link for the current logged-in user to be sent with the report.'=>'若要授予 LiteSpeed 支援團隊 wp-admin 存取權限，請為目前登入的使用者產生一個無密碼連結，並將其隨報告一併發送。','To make sure our server can communicate with your server without any issues and everything works fine, for the few first requests the number of image groups allowed in a single request is limited.'=>'為了確保我們的伺服器能與您的伺服器順利通訊，且一切運作正常，在前幾次請求中，單次請求中允許的圖片組數量將受到限制。','To manage your QUIC.cloud options, go to QUIC.cloud Dashboard.'=>'若要管理您的 QUIC.cloud 設定，請前往 QUIC.cloud 控制台。','To manage your QUIC.cloud options, go to your hosting provider\'s portal.'=>'若要管理您的 QUIC.cloud 設定，請前往您的主機服務供應商入口網站。','To manage your QUIC.cloud options, please contact your hosting provider.'=>'如需管理您的 QUIC.cloud 設定，請聯絡您的主機服務供應商。','To match the beginning, add %s to the beginning of the item.'=>'若要與開頭匹配，請在項目開頭加入 %s。','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'若要防止 %s 被快取，請在此處輸入。','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'為避免磁碟空間耗盡，當系統運作正常時，此設定應設為「關閉」。','To randomize CDN hostname, define multiple hostnames for the same resources.'=>'若要隨機化 CDN 主機名稱，請為相同的資源定義多個主機名稱。','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'如需測試購物車，請造訪 %sFAQ%s。','To use the caching functions you must have a LiteSpeed web server or be using QUIC.cloud CDN.'=>'這個網站必須採用 LiteSpeed 網頁伺服器或 QUIC.cloud CDN，才能使用快取功能。','Tool'=>'工具','Toolbox'=>'工具箱','Total'=>'總計','Total images optimized in this month'=>'本月共優化了多少張圖片','Total Reduction'=>'總減幅','Total Usage'=>'總使用量','Trackbacks/Pingbacks'=>'引用通知/自動引用通知','Trashed Comments'=>'回收桶中的留言','Trashed Posts'=>'回收桶中的文章','Try GitHub Version'=>'試用 GitHub 版本','TTL'=>'TTL','Tuning'=>'微調','Tuning CSS Settings'=>'調整 CSS 設定','Tuning Settings'=>'微調設定','Turn OFF'=>'關閉','Turn ON'=>'開啟','Turn On Auto Upgrade'=>'開啟自動升級','Turn on OptimaX. This will automatically request your pages OptimaX result via cron job.'=>'開啟 OptimaX。系統將透過 cron 工作自動擷取您網頁的 OptimaX 分析結果。','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'開啟此選項可為已登入的使用者快取公開頁面，並透過 ESI 區塊提供管理工具列和留言表單。除非在下方啟用，否則這兩個區塊將不會被快取。','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'在後端編輯器中開啟此功能以控制心跳。','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'開啟此選項以在後端控制心跳。','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'開啟此功能以在前端控制心跳。','Turn this option ON to have LiteSpeed Cache updated automatically, whenever a new version is released. If OFF, update manually as usual.'=>'開啟這項設定後，每當 LiteSpeed Cache 有新版本發佈，便會自動更新；如果關閉這項設定，則必須手動更新外掛。','Turn this option ON to show latest news automatically, including hotfixes, new releases, available beta versions, and promotions.'=>'請開啟此選項，系統將自動顯示最新消息，包括熱修補程式、新版本、可用的測試版以及促銷活動。','Turn this setting %s if you are using a traditional Content Delivery Network (CDN) or a subdomain for static content with QUIC.cloud CDN.'=>'若您正在使用傳統的內容傳遞網路 (CDN)，或透過 QUIC.cloud CDN 為靜態內容設定子網域，請將此設定設為 %s。','Tweet preview'=>'推文預覽','Tweet this'=>'在 Twitter 上分享這則推文','UCSS Inline'=>'UCSS Inline','UCSS Inline Excluded Files'=>'UCSS 內嵌排除檔案','UCSS Selector Allowlist'=>'UCSS 選取器白名單','UCSS URI Excludes'=>'UCSS URI 排除','Unable to automatically add %1$s as a Domain Alias for main %2$s domain, due to potential CDN conflict.'=>'由於可能與 CDN 發生衝突，無法將 %1$s 自動新增為主網域 %2$s 的網域別名。','Unable to automatically add %1$s as a Domain Alias for main %2$s domain.'=>'無法自動將 %1$s 新增為主網域 %2$s 的網域別名。','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'在 %1$s 檔案中發現了意料之外的快取規則 %2$s。由於瀏覽器會將 HTML 頁面儲存至快取，此規則可能會導致訪客看到舊版本的頁面。如果您確定 HTML 頁面未被瀏覽器快取，可以忽略此訊息。(%3$s了解更多%4$s)','Unique CSS'=>'獨特的 CSS','unknown'=>'未知','Unknown error'=>'未知錯誤','Update %s now'=>'立即更新 %s','Upgrade'=>'升級','Upgraded successfully.'=>'已成功升級。','URI Excludes'=>'URI 排除','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'包含這些字串的 URI 路徑將不會被作為公開內容進行快取。','URL'=>'網址','URL list in %s queue waiting for cron'=>'%s 佇列中的 URL 清單正在等待 cron 執行','URL Search'=>'網址搜尋','Usage'=>'用法','Usage Statistics: %s'=>'使用統計：%s','Use %1$s in %2$s to indicate this cookie has not been set.'=>'請在 %2$s 中使用 %1$s 來表示此 Cookie 尚未設定。','Use %1$s to bypass remote image dimension check when %2$s is ON.'=>'當 %2$s 為開啟狀態時，請使用 %1$s 來繞過遠端影像尺寸檢查。','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'對於頁面類型為 %2$s 的頁面，請使用 %1$s 來繞過 UCSS。','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'使用 %1$s 為頁面類型為 %2$s 的頁面生成單一 UCSS，而其他頁面類型則仍按網址分別處理。','Use %s API functionality.'=>'使用 %s API 提供的功能。','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'使用 LiteSpeed 官方設計的預設設定，一鍵完成網站配置。您可以嘗試零風險的快取基礎方案、極致優化方案，或是介於兩者之間的選項。','Use CDN Mapping'=>'使用 CDN 映射','Use external object cache functionality.'=>'使用外部物件快取功能。','Use keep-alive connections to speed up cache operations.'=>'使用保持連線來加快快取操作的速度。','Use latest GitHub Dev commit'=>'使用 GitHub Dev 的最新提交','Use latest GitHub Dev/Master commit'=>'使用 GitHub Dev/Master 分支的最新提交','Use latest GitHub Master commit'=>'使用 GitHub Master 分支的最新提交','Use latest WordPress release version'=>'使用最新版本的 WordPress','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'套用多站網路管理中心設定','Use Optimized Files'=>'使用最佳化檔案','Use Original Files'=>'使用原始檔案','Use original images (unoptimized) on your site'=>'請在您的網站上使用原始圖片（未經優化）','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'使用主要網站組態','Use QUIC.cloud LQIP (Low Quality Image Placeholder) generator service for responsive image previews while loading.'=>'使用 QUIC.cloud 的 LQIP（低畫質圖片佔位符）生成服務，在載入過程中提供響應式圖片預覽。','Use QUIC.cloud online service to generate critical CSS and load remaining CSS asynchronously.'=>'使用 QUIC.cloud 線上服務來產生關鍵 CSS，並以非同步方式載入其餘的 CSS。','Use QUIC.cloud online service to generate unique CSS.'=>'使用 QUIC.cloud 線上服務來產生獨特的 CSS。','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'請使用 %1$s 或 %2$s 的格式（元素為可選）。','Use this section to switch plugin versions. To beta test a GitHub commit, enter the commit URL in the field below.'=>'請使用此區段切換外掛程式版本。若要測試 GitHub 提交的測試版，請在下方欄位中輸入提交的 URL。','Use Web Font Loader library to load Google Fonts asynchronously while leaving other CSS intact.'=>'使用 Web Font Loader 函式庫，在不影響其他 CSS 的情況下，以非同步方式載入 Google Fonts。','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'對於會導致 CLS（Core Web Vitals 指標之一）的「瀏覽視區內」圖片特別有用。','user agents'=>'使用者代理程式','Username'=>'使用者名稱','Using optimized version of file. '=>'使用該檔案的優化版本。','Value from filter applied'=>'已套用篩選條件的結果','Value range'=>'數值範圍','Variables %s will be replaced with the configured background color.'=>'變數 %s 將被替換為設定的背景色。','Variables %s will be replaced with the corresponding image properties.'=>'變數 %s 將被替換為對應的圖片屬性。','Vary Cookies'=>'變更 Cookie 設定','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'適用於 Mini Cart','Vary Group'=>'Vary Group','View %1$s version %2$s details'=>'檢視 %1$s %2$s 的詳細資料','View .htaccess'=>'檢視 .htaccess','View Site Before Cache'=>'檢視快取前的網站','View Site Before Optimization'=>'優化前的網站預覽','Viewport Image'=>'檢視窗格圖片','Viewport Image Generation'=>'視口影像生成','Viewport Images'=>'視口圖像','Viewport Images Cron'=>'檢視窗格圖片 Cron','Visit LSCWP support forum'=>'造訪 LSCWP 技術支援論壇','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'請在登出狀態下造訪該網站。','VPI'=>'VPI','Waiting'=>'等待','Waiting to be Crawled'=>'等待被爬取','Want to connect with other LiteSpeed users?'=>'想和其他 LiteSpeed 使用者交流嗎？','WARNING'=>'警告','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'警告：.htaccess 登入 Cookie 與資料庫登入 Cookie 不一致。','Watch Crawler Status'=>'查看爬蟲狀態','We are good. No table uses MyISAM engine.'=>'沒問題。沒有任何資料表使用 MyISAM 儲存引擎。','We are working hard to improve your online service experience. The service will be unavailable while we work. We apologize for any inconvenience.'=>'我們正致力於提升您的線上服務體驗。系統維護期間，服務將暫時中斷。造成不便，敬請見諒。','WebP file reduced by %1$s (%2$s)'=>'WebP 檔案已壓縮 %1$s (%2$s)','WebP saved %s'=>'已將 %s 儲存為 WebP 格式','WebP/AVIF Attribute To Replace'=>'WebP/AVIF 屬性將被取代','WebP/AVIF For Extra srcset'=>'WebP/AVIF 用於額外的 srcset','Welcome to LiteSpeed'=>'歡迎使用 LiteSpeed','What is a group?'=>'什麼是群組？','What is an image group?'=>'什麼是圖像群組？','When a visitor hovers over a page link, preload that page. This will speed up the visit to that link.'=>'當訪客將滑鼠懸停在頁面連結上時，請預先載入該頁面。此舉將加快瀏覽該連結的速度。','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'停用快取時，此網站的所有快取項目將會被清除。','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'啟用此功能後，當任何外掛、佈景主題或 WordPress 核心進行升級時，快取將會自動清除。','When minifying HTML do not discard comments that match a specified pattern.'=>'在壓縮 HTML 時，請勿刪除符合指定模式的註解。','When switching formats, please %1$s or %2$s to apply this new choice to previously optimized images.'=>'在切換格式時，請 %1$s 或 %2$s，以將此新設定套用至先前已優化的圖片。','When this option is turned %s, it will also load Google Fonts asynchronously.'=>'當此選項設定為 %s 時，系統也會以非同步方式載入 Google Fonts。','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'當您使用 Lazy Load 時，它會延遲頁面中所有圖片的載入。','Who should use this preset?'=>'誰適合使用這個預設？','Why are you deactivating the plugin?'=>'為什麼要停用這個外掛？','Widget Cache TTL'=>'小工具快取 TTL','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'支援 %1$s 通配符（匹配零個或多個字元）。例如，若要同時匹配 %2$s 和 %3$s，請使用 %4$s。','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'支援 %s 通配符。','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'透過 ESI（邊緣側包含），系統可針對已登入的使用者從快取中提供網頁。','With QUIC.cloud CDN enabled, you may still be seeing cache headers from your local server.'=>'即使已啟用 QUIC.cloud CDN，您仍可能會看到來自本地伺服器的快取標頭。','WooCommerce Settings'=>'WooCommerce 設定','WordPress Image Quality Control'=>'WordPress 圖片品質控制','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'WordPress 的有效時間間隔為 %s 秒。','WpW: Private Cache vs. Public Cache'=>'WpW: 私密快取與公開快取的比較','Yearly archive'=>'年份彙整','You are currently using services as an anonymous user. To manage your QUIC.cloud options, use the button below to create an account and link to the QUIC.cloud Dashboard.'=>'您目前是以匿名使用者身分使用服務。若要管理您的 QUIC.cloud 設定，請使用下方按鈕建立帳戶，並連結至 QUIC.cloud 控制台。','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'您只需輸入網域名稱的一部分即可。','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'您可以在此列出第三方 Vary Cookie。','You can quickly switch between using original (unoptimized versions) and optimized image files. It will affect all images on your website, both regular and webp versions if available.'=>'您可以快速在使用原始（未優化版本）與優化後的圖片檔案之間切換。此設定將影響網站上的所有圖片，無論是一般版本或 WebP 版本（如有）。','You can request a maximum of %s images at once.'=>'您一次最多可請求 %s 張圖片。','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'您也可以在伺服器管理介面中啟用瀏覽器快取。%s進一步了解 LiteSpeed 瀏覽器快取設定%s。','You can turn shortcodes into ESI blocks.'=>'您可以將短代碼轉為 ESI 區塊。','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'您可以使用 %1$s in %2$s 這段代碼來指定 .htaccess 檔案的路徑。','You cannot remove this DNS zone, because it is still in use. Please update the domain\'s nameservers, then try to delete this zone again, otherwise your site will become inaccessible.'=>'您無法刪除此 DNS 區域，因為它目前仍在使用中。請先更新該網域的名稱伺服器，然後再嘗試刪除此區域；否則您的網站將無法存取。','You have images waiting to be pulled. Please wait for the automatic pull to complete, or pull them down manually now.'=>'您有待下載的圖片。請等待自動下載完成，或立即手動下載。','You have too many requested images, please try again in a few minutes.'=>'您請求的圖片數量過多，請稍後幾分鐘再試。','You have used all of your daily quota for today.'=>'您已用完今日的每日配額。','You have used all of your quota left for current service this month.'=>'您已用完本月當前服務的剩餘配額。','You just unlocked a promotion from QUIC.cloud!'=>'您剛從 QUIC.cloud 解鎖了一項優惠！','You must be using one of the following products in order to measure Page Load Time:'=>'若要測量頁面載入時間，您必須使用以下其中一種產品：','You must set %1$s to %2$s before using this feature.'=>'在使用此功能之前，您必須將 %1$s 設定為 %2$s。','You must set %s before using this feature.'=>'使用此功能前，您必須先設定 %s。','You need to activate QC first.'=>'您需要先啟用 QC。','You need to set the %1$s first. Please use the command %2$s to set.'=>'您需要先設定 %1$s。請使用 %2$s 指令進行設定。','You need to set the %s in Settings first before using the crawler'=>'在使用爬蟲程式之前，您需要先在「設定」中設定 %s','You need to turn %s on and finish all WebP generation to get maximum result.'=>'您需要啟用 %s 並完成所有 WebP 生成作業，才能獲得最佳效果。','You need to turn %s on to get maximum result.'=>'您需要開啟 %s 才能獲得最佳效果。','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'一旦備份被刪除，您將無法還原最佳化設定！','You will need to finish %s setup to use the online services.'=>'您需要完成 %s 的設定，才能使用線上服務。','Your %1$s quota on %2$s will still be in use.'=>'您在 %2$s 上的 %1$s 配額仍將被佔用。','Your %s Hostname or IP address.'=>'您的 %s 主機名稱或 IP 位址。','Your API key / token is used to access %s APIs.'=>'您的 API 金鑰／憑證是用來存取 %s API 的。','Your application is waiting for approval.'=>'您的申請正在等待審核。','Your domain has been forbidden from using our services due to a previous policy violation.'=>'由於您先前違反了相關政策，您的網域已被禁止使用我們的服務。','Your domain_key has been temporarily blocklisted to prevent abuse. You may contact support at QUIC.cloud to learn more.'=>'您的 domain_key 已暫時被列入黑名單，以防止濫用。如需進一步了解，請聯絡 QUIC.cloud 的客服支援。','Your Email address on %s.'=>'%s 帳號的電子郵件地址。','Your IP'=>'目前的 IP 位址','Your server IP'=>'您的伺服器 IP','Your site is connected and ready to use QUIC.cloud Online Services.'=>'您的網站已連線，並可開始使用 QUIC.cloud 線上服務。','Your site is connected and using QUIC.cloud Online Services as an <strong>anonymous user</strong>. The CDN function and certain features of optimization services are not available for anonymous users. Link to QUIC.cloud to use the CDN and all available Online Services features.'=>'您的網站已連線，並以 <strong>匿名使用者</strong> 身分使用 QUIC.cloud 線上服務。匿名使用者無法使用 CDN 功能及部分優化服務功能。請連結至 QUIC.cloud 以使用 CDN 及所有可用的線上服務功能。','Zero, or'=>'零，或']];
